      },
      "text": "Actuators are where computation meets physics. Every joint torque from the controller\nmust be physically produced by a motor, drive, and transmission. The choice of actuator\ndetermines what the robot can do."
    },
    {
      "id": "07-ACTUATORS.md#003",
      "path": [
        "07-ACTUATORS.md"
