      "text": "CIRCUIT EQUATION:\n  V = R * I + L * dI/dt + Ke * omega\n  V:  applied voltage\n  R:  armature resistance\n  L:  armature inductance"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-ACTUATORS.md#012",
      "path": [
        "07-ACTUATORS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
