        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Robotics - Actuators",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "At steady-state (dI/dt = 0):\n  I = (V - Ke * omega) / R\n  tau = Kt * (V - Ke * omega) / R"
    },
