      "text": "SPEED-TORQUE CURVE:\n  tau         Stall torque: tau_stall = Kt * V / R   (omega = 0)\n  ^\n  | *\n  |  *\n  |   *    Linear. Higher V shifts curve up.\n  |    *\n  +-------> omega\n         No-load speed: omega_nl = V / Ke   (tau = 0)\n```"
